## Diagnostic Funnel Analysis for Video Ads

Looking solely at ROAS or CPC will not tell you why an ad failed. By breaking down your video analytics into discrete checkpoints, you can pinpoint the exact flaw:

1. **3-Second Hook Rate (3s Views / Impressions)**: Evaluates opening stopping power.
2. **Hold Rate (15s Views / 3s Views)**: Evaluates storytelling engagement and script retention.
3. **Outbound Click-Through Rate (Clicks / Impressions)**: Evaluates offer strength and CTA clarity.
4. **Click-to-Add-to-Cart Ratio**: Evaluates alignment between video messaging and landing page reality.
